1
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,480
What's wrong?

2
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,440
Are you okay?

3
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,640
I think I sprained my ankle.

4
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,720
Hop on. I'll carry you.

5
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,320
Take her weapon.

6
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:46,400
Help her up.

7
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:53,600
Let's go.

8
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,400
You seem to be in a good mood.

9
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,560
You even have time to design a report cover.

10
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,800
Actually, this operation

11
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:05,320
isn't that difficult from a technical standpoint.

12
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,720
The real challenge is gathering intelligence

13
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,440
and pulling off an effective deception.

14
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:11,440
Yeah.

15
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,040
Right now, everything is ready.

16
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,160
We're just waiting on the final piece.

17
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:15,960
Don't worry.

18
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,600
Squad Leader Hong can complete this operation.

19
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,280
Stay alert

20
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,240
Binoculars.

21
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:50,320
Yes, sir.

22
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,120
Found it.

23
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:02,480
How come I didn't see it?

24
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:05,040
All their light sources are completely covered up.

25
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,520
They're completely invisible to the naked eye.

26
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,320
But

27
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,800
night vision binoculars are very sensitive to light spots.

28
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,040
Use the night vision equipment right now

29
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,560
to lock in their coordinates

30
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,560
and capture their frequency bands.

31
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,400
Yes, sir.

32
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,000
Platoon Leader Yang, you're awesome!

33
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,720
I wonder what Guo Zijian

34
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,520
is really up to.

35
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,280
He's always pulling these mysterious tricks.

36
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,760
Since the sea training, this is

37
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:28,480
the Yufeng Battalion

38
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,520
and the 404th Brigade's

39
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,600
first direct confrontation.

40
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,640
It's also Guo Zijian

41
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,720
and Long Yuanshan's

42
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,800
first truly meaningful

43
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,520
showdown.

44
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,240
So,

45
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,800
acting cautiously to avoid leaking intel

46
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,800
is perfectly normal.

47
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:48,600
Wangyuan,

48
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,160
I think

49
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,200
your attitude toward Guo Zijian

50
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,000
from now on

51
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:57,040
should be more objective.

52
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,280
Don't always be so prejudiced.

53
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:04,760
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

54
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,000
after this sea training,

55
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,240
I feel like you've changed.

56
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:12,040
In what way?

57
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:16,640
Your attitude toward us old subordinates has changed.

58
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:22,280
You and Jiang Shengqiang are soldiers I trained myself.

59
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,240
I know you very well,

60
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,240
like you're my own children.

61
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:29,880
In the past,

62
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,000
I was a bit lenient.

63
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,200
My own standards

64
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,800
weren't very high, either.

65
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,720
But in the long run,

66
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,920
that might have harmed you.

67
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:43,720
Wangyuan,

68
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,120
I hope

69
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,800
you'll all focus your energy on work from now on.

70
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,920
What's going on with you today?

71
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,720
Did Guo Zijian brainwash you again?

72
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,920
Let's wait until the exercise is over.

73
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,560
We'll find some time

74
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,920
to have a good talk.

75
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,840
Hong Xiafei sent a message.

76
00:05:09,960 --> 00:05:12,480
Confirmed the Blue Army command post is in Wolf Valley.

77
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:13,120
Good.

78
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,880
Attention, entire Yufeng Battalion.

79
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,120
Officially initiate

80
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,160
Operation Diana.

81
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:18,480
Yes, sir.

82
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,160
Yes, sir.

83
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:23,400
Report.

84
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,520
The Red Army command post has been spotted.

85
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,160
Is the location confirmed?

86
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,000
Not confirmed yet,

87
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:27,760
but we can determine

88
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,080
that its position has changed.

89
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,880
If he wants a fight to the death with me,

90
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,200
he needs to have what it takes.

91
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,400
Connect to all battalions immediately.

92
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:36,920
Yes, sir.

93
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,800
Report. Connection successful.

94
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,680
Attention, all battalions.

95
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,000
This is Long Yuanshan.

96
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,440
The Red Army reserves,

97
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:50,080
after merging with their remaining forces,

98
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:52,200
are very likely to mount a desperate last stand

99
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,680
to try and turn the tide of defeat.

100
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:54,920
I order:

101
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:55,720
One.

102
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Stay on high alert and avoid sneak attacks.

103
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:58,800
Two.

104
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,280
Once the Brigade Command confirms the enemy target,

105
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:03,040
all battalions must cooperate fully

106
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,280
to finish them off in a single strike.

107
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:05,320
Three.

108
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,680
According to recon analysis,

109
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,600
the Red Army reserves are only one combined arms battalion strong,

110
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,000
and they have already been deployed separately.

111
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,560
Once any battalion spots the target,

112
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,760
you may execute a strike independently.

113
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,360
Over.

114
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,200
1st Battalion, copy.

115
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,640
2nd Battalion, copy.

116
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:18,680
3rd Battalion, copy.

117
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:24,960
Don't rush.

118
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,560
The best part is yet to come.

119
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:28,560
Platoon Leader,

120
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,480
we spotted a Blue Army recon squad ahead.

121
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,400
They're heading this way.

122
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:43,040
Has anyone used the radio communication system?

123
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:43,640
No.

124
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,160
Good. We haven't been compromised.

125
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,480
Lin Yihu.

126
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:47,880
Here!

127
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,520
Lead Squad One and protect Squad Leader Hong.

128
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,880
Unless absolutely necessary,

129
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,920
do not expose your position.

130
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:54,480
Yes, sir.

131
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,000
Platoon Leader, what about you?

132
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,960
I have to get captured.

133
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,600
It's the only way to dispel the Blue Force's suspicions.

134
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,840
Let me go instead.

135
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,520
They won't believe it if you go.

136
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,480
Squad Two, follow me.

137
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:50,040
Operation Great Shift is ready.

138
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:55,280
1st Battalion.

139
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,600
1st Battalion, standing by.

140
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,360
Orders.

141
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,480
The Red Army's main reserve force

142
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,280
is confirmed at grid square 3850.

143
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,960
For operations in this area,

144
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,240
your battalion is best positioned.

145
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:05,800
Quickly deploy heavy firepower

146
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,600
for saturation fire

147
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,680
to annihilate the enemy.

148
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,040
1st Battalion, copy.

149
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,040
2nd Battalion.

150
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,640
2nd Battalion, standing by.

151
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:15,640
Confirmed:

152
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,880
the Red Army's main reserve force

153
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,840
is at grid square 3857.

154
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,400
Your battalion is best positioned for this area.

155
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:24,000
Quickly deploy heavy firepower

156
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:27,120
for saturation fire to annihilate the enemy.

157
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:28,920
2nd Battalion, copy.

158
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,120
3rd Battalion.

159
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,240
3rd Battalion, standing by.

160
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:33,840
Orders.

161
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:40,880
Director Zhou,

162
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,000
what's the situation?

163
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:42,880
The battle has started.

164
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,960
Long Yuanshan was just issuing strike orders.

165
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:48,120
And the coordinates were highly precise.

166
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,880
Any activity from the Red Army?

167
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,040
We've been monitoring them.

168
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,960
They emitted a brief signal just now,

169
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,760
but have now resumed radio silence.

170
00:08:58,880 --> 00:08:59,680
Professor Zhang,

171
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,400
you went to the restroom

172
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,720
and missed a great show.

173
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,400
Is that so?

174
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,360
Grenade

175
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,280
Let's go, Platoon Leader Yang.

176
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,520
This trick

177
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:33,760
is pretty underhanded.

178
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:38,000
In the eyes of the Blue Army's long-range artillery,

179
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,800
the 399th Brigade's command post

180
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,560
instantly became

181
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,880
Long Yuanshan's command post.

182
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,520
Didn't he want to find the Red Army's brain?

183
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:47,920
I marked it for him.

184
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,760
You are

185
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:53,240
using Long Yuanshan's own long-range artillery

186
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,800
to strike his own command post?

187
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,120
Isn't that a bit too ruthless?

188
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,160
When Long Yuanshan figures it out,

189
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,920
won't he go crazy?

190
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,560
Think about it,

191
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,680
when has he ever been soft on us?

192
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,440
This is Goddess Diana's revenge.

193
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:14,000
Those who desecrate her will eventually become prey,

194
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,760
killed by their own hunting companions.

195
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,600
This is Project Diana.

196
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,480
Then what should our team

197
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,320
be doing right now?

198
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,520
Clean up the battlefield

199
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,640
and reap the fruits of victory.

200
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,560
Signalman!

201
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:30,080
Sir!

202
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,440
Get me Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

203
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,000
Yes, sir!

204
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:35,320
Probably worried that making any sound

205
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,360
would easily expose them,

206
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,880
so during the capture,

207
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,360
everyone's individual communication system

208
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,080
was turned off.

209
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,400
I can confirm

210
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,320
that Yang Maolin

211
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,880
didn't transmit a single word out.

212
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:47,240
So you're saying this reserve force of the 399th Brigade

213
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,760
is your Yufeng Battalion.

214
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:53,840
Staff Officer Wang!

215
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,480
Sir!

216
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:55,920
Notify all battalions immediately:

217
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,120
Yufeng Battalion has entered the battle.

218
00:10:57,200 --> 00:11:00,080
Be extremely careful of that little fox, Guo Zijian.

219
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:00,600
Yes, sir!

220
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,360
The little fox is still green.

221
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,240
He can't outsmart an old fox like you.

222
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,160
Haven't you heard the story

223
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:14,160
of wild punches beating an old master?

224
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:18,680
If we had known from the very beginning

225
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,160
that our opponent was Yufeng Battalion,

226
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:21,040
it wouldn't be scary.

227
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,720
But the fact that he still hasn't

228
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,440
shown his true colors until now

229
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:27,120
is truly a bit terrifying.

230
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:28,440
Being uninformed,

231
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:29,680
unaware,

232
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,800
and unprepared,

233
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,320
makes them the most dangerous rival.

234
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,320
Tell me,

235
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,120
how did you sneak in here, kid?

236
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:41,200
Chief,

237
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,160
what I know

238
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,880
is just as much as you do.

239
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,280
Scram, scram! Get him out of here!

240
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,720
Just seeing him annoys me.

241
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:51,920
Little brat!

242
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,480
Didn't even call during the holidays!

243
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,800
He did call me, actually.

244
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,520
He probably called me too.

245
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,560
I just missed it.

246
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,800
I agree with your suggestion.

247
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:09,880
Wolf Valley.

248
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,200
Isn't Wolf Valley Blue Army territory?

249
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,840
This Guo Zijian wants to use you as a human shield again!

250
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,280
He wants to give me an opportunity

251
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:23,040
to win back my pride.

252
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,320
Staff Officer Hu!

253
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:25,960
Sir!

254
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:27,920
Deploy a platoon from the reserve force.

255
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,480
Have them take two

256
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:30,560
combat helicopters

257
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:31,720
and escort Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

258
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,560
to collect Brigade Commander Long's body.

259
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,280
Ground forces are already approaching.

260
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,760
No need to worry about security.

261
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:37,480
Yes, sir!

262
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,240
Staff Officer Liang!

263
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:42,880
Sir!

264
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:44,800
Launch the final attack!

265
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:45,440
Yes, sir!

266
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,080
Blue Army Artillery Fire Support,

267
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,080
please respond if you copy.

268
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,200
Artillery Fire Support.

269
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:58,960
It's confirmed

270
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,600
that the Red Army command post

271
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:01,600
is in Wolf Valley.

272
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,720
Coordinates sent.

273
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:04,760
Please execute a precision strike immediately.

274
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,760
Ultra-long-range firepower copies.

275
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:36,760
Look, Old Liang,

276
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,200
is that it?

277
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,280
Are you really using the Yufeng Battalion?

278
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,760
I feel like if you pulled out any random battalion,

279
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:45,280
we'd at least hear some noise tonight.

280
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:46,720
No.

281
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,960
How would I dare disobey the commander's orders?

282
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,520
I issued all these missions personally.

283
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,440
Then that's really weird.

284
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,520
So this is what you two had in mind.

285
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,040
You wanted the Yufeng Battalion to show off.

286
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:04,640
The results are in.

287
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,320
Well?

288
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:07,320
The Yufeng Battalion is simply not ready.

289
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,640
They are far from capable of three-dimensional combat,

290
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:10,560
long-range mobility,

291
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,120
and platform operations.

292
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:13,520
Besides, they just

293
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:15,160
rushed back from hundreds of kilometers away.

294
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:21,680
Staff Officer Wang!

295
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:22,320
Here!

296
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:23,400
Notify everyone.

297
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:24,280
As originally planned,

298
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:24,960
in ten minutes,

299
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:25,880
we relocate the command post.

300
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,360
Yes, sir!

301
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:31,480
What's going on?

302
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,160
Look.

303
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,400
What is this?

304
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,840
Why the sudden twist?

305
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:41,680
No way.

306
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,960
This comeback by the Yufeng Battalion is too bizarre.

307
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,800
The 404th Brigade

308
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,880
used its own firepower

309
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,560
to strike its own command post?

310
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,120
How is that possible?

311
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,760
Could our exercise control system

312
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:56,840
have been taken over by them too?

313
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:08,280
Commander Long! Commander Long!

314
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:11,200
The exercise is over.

315
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:14,920
Please step out of your command post with dignity.

316
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,960
Commander Long! Commander Long!

317
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,760
The exercise is over.

318
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:24,600
Please step out of your command post with dignity.

319
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,480
As bizarre as it seems,

320
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,320
the facts cannot be changed.

321
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,040
In this battle,

322
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:03,000
they used information and firepower warfare,

323
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:05,600
and even strategic and espionage warfare.

324
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,920
Interesting.

325
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:08,920
Professor Zhang.

326
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:10,160
Professor Zhang.

327
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,760
Staying up all night tonight

328
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:13,000
wasn't a waste of time, was it?

329
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:17,440
Indeed.

330
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:19,760
This battle

331
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,520
made me see Guo Zijian's Value Cube

332
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,880
in a completely new light.

333
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:25,720
The facts fully prove that you are right.

334
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,280
Future combat

335
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:29,200
is moving toward miniaturization,

336
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,560
modularity, and intelligence.

337
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:31,640
Multi-dimensional development

338
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:32,920
is unstoppable.

339
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:33,800
Lao Liang,

340
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,360
it's not that you moved too fast.

341
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:36,840
It's that I'm old

342
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,200
and too conservative.

343
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:39,320
Professor Zhang,

344
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,320
you're being too modest.

345
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,000
Besides Guo Zijian,

346
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,880
another contributor, a great one,

347
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,440
is also your top student.

348
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,000
Comrades of the Blue Force,

349
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:56,720
good work out there.

350
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,080
You fought well.

351
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,200
Good work to you, Brigade Commander Long.

352
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,720
The same battlefield,

353
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:10,520
a similar night sky,

354
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:11,720
only

355
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:13,280
the outcome is reversed.

356
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,000
Feels familiar, doesn't it?

357
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:18,400
If Deputy Commander Suo commanded personally

358
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:21,040
and captured a live Long Yuanshan,

359
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,880
the result would be even more perfect.

360
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,040
There's no need.

361
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:26,520
To kill a chicken,

362
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:28,040
you don't need a butcher's knife.

363
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,360
A battalion commander under me can handle it.

364
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,400
As long as I can personally

365
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,800
collect your corpse,

366
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,280
that's perfect enough.

367
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,400
History is written by the victors.

368
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:39,560
I have nothing to say.

369
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:42,000
Staff Officer Hu!

370
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:42,520
Sir!

371
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,200
Clear the battlefield.

372
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:44,640
Yes, sir!

373
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:46,400
All right,

374
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:49,760
let's wait for dawn.

375
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,200
See you in the control hall.

376
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:00,000
He only won this one time.

377
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,600
Look how smug he is.

378
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,240
"Wait for dawn"? Give me a break.

379
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:05,640
He's full of it.

380
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:08,520
All right.

381
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:09,840
Let's go.

382
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:11,800
Let's go and listen

383
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,680
to exactly where we lost this time.

384
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:28,120
Our idea

385
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:30,440
comes from an ancient Greek myth.

386
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,560
Legend has it that

387
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,280
Diana, goddess of the moon,

388
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:36,640
was bathing in the forest

389
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,840
when a hunter in the forest,

390
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,480
Actaeon, searching for deer,

391
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,480
accidentally saw her.

392
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,360
In order to take revenge on Actaeon,

393
00:18:43,520 --> 00:18:45,480
Diana turned him into a deer,

394
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,480
causing his own teammates and hounds

395
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,400
to mistake him for prey and brutally kill him.

396
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:52,840
This time, the Black Mamba 404th Brigade

397
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:54,520
became the pitiful Actaeon.

398
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:58,040
The idea for the entire operational plan

399
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,680
came from our Battalion Commander Guo.

400
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,000
Of course,

401
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,280
his proposal of the idea

402
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:04,280
was mostly based on our whole team's

403
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,880
operational characteristics and strength.

404
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,640
Battalion Commander Guo has stated more than once

405
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:10,120
that the combination of the Value Cube

406
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:12,000
is always based on battlefield realities.

407
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,160
Therefore,

408
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,680
how the cube transforms,

409
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:16,240
whether the operational scale is large or small,

410
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,200
whether the firepower strike is light or heavy,

411
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:19,800
whether the personnel deployed are many or few,

412
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,800
whether weapons and equipment are increased or decreased,

413
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,160
are all based on

414
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:24,320
the operational target

415
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:26,160
and the actual battlefield conditions.

416
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,840
So then,

417
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:32,000
the tactic implemented by Guo Zijian and your team,

418
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,000
using the enemy's spear to attack their shield,

419
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,840
what is its primary basis?

420
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:37,600
Reporting to the commander,

421
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,960
the reason our idea could be realized

422
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:41,720
is mainly due to the following conditions.

423
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:45,920
One,

424
00:19:46,600 --> 00:19:48,880
the opponent was unaware of Yufeng Battalion's involvement.

425
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:49,800
Two,

426
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:53,240
the opponent was extremely confident in their info strength.

427
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:54,080
Three,

428
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:56,640
regarding the location of their command post,

429
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,560
the opponent never had any doubts.

430
00:19:57,760 --> 00:19:58,160
Four,

431
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,800
our information platforms were highly compatible.

432
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:01,760
Five,

433
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,240
our various operational modules

434
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,320
executed their deception functions flawlessly.

435
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,760
This also includes

436
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:08,200
a series of directional misdirections

437
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:09,080
by Zeng Muhan's team.

438
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:10,160
Six,

439
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:13,720
we knew the opponent's communication frequencies, bands,

440
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,120
and their switching characteristics

441
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,240
like the back of our hand.

442
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,360
Of course, there are other reasons as well,

443
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,000
but these six points

444
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,640
are the most crucial factors.

445
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:26,280
Could you explain this using a specific combat example?

446
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:27,720
Yes.

447
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,320
In this operation,

448
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:32,280
the sole mission of Yang Maolin's special ops platoon

449
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:35,200
was to ensure the information warfare team completed its mission.

450
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,680
You could say

451
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:41,120
the mission was set by the information warfare team,

452
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:43,800
but during the specific implementation process,

453
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:46,480
the special ops platoon provided reasonable suggestions multiple times,

454
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:48,400
and at the final critical moment,

455
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:50,240
Yang Maolin split his forces into two.

456
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,600
He took the initiative to expose himself,

457
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:53,280
and perished together with the Blue Force,

458
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,400
thereby ensuring

459
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:56,560
the successful strike on the Blue Force command structure.

460
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:57,720
Furthermore,

461
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,000
when Zeng Muhan's team encountered enemy reconnaissance en route,

462
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:01,120
they were able to skillfully neutralize it,

463
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:02,720
and deepened the Blue Force's

464
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,120
fixed impression of our striking force pattern,

465
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:07,960
providing an effective illusion for our information warfare.

466
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:09,880
What does this illustrate?

467
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,440
It shows that human subjective initiative,

468
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,960
whether yesterday, today,

469
00:21:16,320 --> 00:21:17,560
or in the future,

470
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:20,040
always exceeds the weapons and equipment themselves

471
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:21,640
with even greater value potential.

472
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:41,960
I know

473
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:44,000
many people might think

474
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,960
that our Yufeng Battalion's exercise this time

475
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:47,280
was successful

476
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,880
because we had a certain

477
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,080
technological advantage.

478
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,200
True.

479
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,960
Operation Diana, which we executed today,

480
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,440
indeed benefited from

481
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,040
the right time, place, and people.

482
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,080
But our battalion commander always emphasizes

483
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:02,360
that combat itself is the interplay of the expected and unexpected.

484
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,640
When the battlefield situation allows for a tactical advantage,

485
00:22:04,640 --> 00:22:06,000
failing to seize it means a missed opportunity.

486
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,680
When the situation is unfavorable to us,

487
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:09,280
forcing an attack means losing our position.

488
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:10,440
So,

489
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,440
although technologically

490
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,160
we did have some advantages,

491
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:16,200
without our battalion commander's

492
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,200
unique creativity,

493
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,800
along with his guidance to

494
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:21,240
adapt to specific changes on the battlefield,

495
00:22:21,960 --> 00:22:23,240
our ideas

496
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:25,600
would only exist in theory,

497
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:28,160
and be far from translating into an actual victory.

498
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:53,400
Brigade Commander Long.

499
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:59,960
The "Sword and Rainbow" duo

500
00:23:00,360 --> 00:23:01,440
certainly lives up to its reputation.

501
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:05,120
You two truly are the perfect golden duo.

502
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,440
I'm actually a little jealous.

503
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,880
If I had managed to get Guo Zijian

504
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:10,880
transferred to my unit back then,

505
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:13,160
would I have gotten a buy-one-get-one deal,

506
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:14,120
and scored Staff Officer Liang too?

507
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:16,680
Brigade Commander Long,

508
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:18,680
the soldiers were just joking around.

509
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,120
Why are you joining in on the teasing?

510
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:24,160
This guy is full of tricks.

511
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:25,640
You need to be careful.

512
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,440
The smarter the girl,

513
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:33,480
the easier she falls for guys like him.

514
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:36,640
Now you're just blatantly sowing discord.

515
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:38,040
Alright.

516
00:23:39,080 --> 00:23:40,120
I admit defeat this time.

517
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:42,840
We'll have plenty of chances out on the field.

518
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:44,120
We'll battle again next time.

519
00:23:54,840 --> 00:23:55,880
What kind of man is he talking about?

520
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:58,000
Probably someone like the instructor.

521
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,040
The slightly sleazy type.

522
00:24:06,320 --> 00:24:07,800
You two little rascals.

523
00:24:07,800 --> 00:24:08,880
Pulling a stunt like this today,

524
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:10,120
you even managed to fool me.

525
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:14,680
What's that saying on the internet?

526
00:24:14,800 --> 00:24:17,160
When the times abandon you,

527
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:19,120
they won't even say goodbye.

528
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,560
When I was young, I loved taking photos.

529
00:24:22,840 --> 00:24:24,120
I used film back then.

530
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:26,600
A few years later, digital cameras came out,

531
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:28,280
and film became obsolete.

532
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,760
After a few years with digital cameras,

533
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,840
smartphones could take pictures too.

534
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,240
You see?

535
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,880
While you're still searching for the enemy,

536
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:38,280
the battlefield is already gone.

537
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,000
During today's drill,

538
00:24:40,360 --> 00:24:41,520
I felt exactly like that.

539
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,520
Sir, you're being modest.

540
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:46,160
That's why we

541
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:48,200
must continuously learn

542
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:49,120
to improve

543
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:50,280
and reinvent ourselves.

544
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,360
Otherwise,

545
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:53,520
we'll just be left behind by the times.

546
00:24:54,000 --> 00:24:54,840
Yes, sir.

547
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,800
I personally

548
00:24:57,400 --> 00:24:58,240
feel the exact same way.

549
00:24:59,520 --> 00:25:00,720
You feel that way too?

550
00:25:01,560 --> 00:25:03,200
Then I guess we're about even.

551
00:25:03,360 --> 00:25:04,560
No, no, no, sir.

552
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,680
I wouldn't dare claim that.

553
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:09,720
The battle lasted all night.

554
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:10,920
And the meeting lasted all day.

555
00:25:11,360 --> 00:25:12,440
You all rest up here.

556
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:13,160
We'll head back tomorrow.

557
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:15,440
Since you won the battle,

558
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:16,680
I'm granting you

559
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,160
an extra day off.

560
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,400
There'll be a celebratory dinner tonight.

561
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:20,680
Let's celebrate properly.

562
00:25:22,760 --> 00:25:26,000
There won't be any Level 3 combat readiness alerts, right?

563
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:28,320
You just reminded me.

564
00:25:28,760 --> 00:25:29,640
Let me tell you,

565
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:30,760
anything is possible.

566
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:34,240
No, there won't be. Tonight,

567
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,600
just have a good time.

568
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:36,680
Yes, Sir!

569
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:39,560
Lao Suo.

570
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:42,600
You don't mind me calling you Lao Suo, do you?

571
00:25:43,520 --> 00:25:44,040
Not at all.

572
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:47,080
What I want to say is,

573
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:49,320
for Yufeng Battalion

574
00:25:49,800 --> 00:25:51,040
and Guo Zijian to be where they are today,

575
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:52,880
you deserve a lot of the credit.

576
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:54,720
Chief.

577
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:57,560
I really don't deserve such high praise.

578
00:25:58,520 --> 00:25:59,320
You deserve it.

579
00:26:00,080 --> 00:26:01,080
Not only do you deserve it,

580
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:02,680
but I also want to thank you.

581
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:04,840
As for a soldier like Guo Zijian,

582
00:26:05,520 --> 00:26:06,480
you didn't lead him astray,

583
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,200
nor did you misguide him.

584
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:11,200
In the past, a decapitation strike on Long Yuanshan...

585
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,920
he definitely wouldn't have missed it.

586
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:14,360
But look at him now.

587
00:26:14,800 --> 00:26:16,160
The change is quite obvious.

588
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,640
What does this show?

589
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,000
It's because you

590
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:21,800
gave your soldiers enough sense of security

591
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:24,320
and the space to showcase their talents.

592
00:26:25,200 --> 00:26:25,960
You

593
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:27,880
are a good leader.

594
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,880
Hearing you say this,

595
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,160
I feel quite ashamed.

596
00:26:32,840 --> 00:26:34,120
Actually, I know very well

597
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,520
that there are some things

598
00:26:36,360 --> 00:26:37,440
I haven't done well enough.

599
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:38,720
Lao Suo.

600
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:41,160
Let me remind you,

601
00:26:42,160 --> 00:26:44,640
you need to leave room for your own improvement.

602
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:47,720
A person can't always dwell on past regrets.

603
00:26:48,520 --> 00:26:50,720
You have to realize that it's because of past regrets

604
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:53,400
that the future can be closer to perfection.

605
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:55,040
Do you understand what I mean?

606
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:56,240
Yes, Chief.

607
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:59,080
Capturing Long Yuanshan this time,

608
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,760
I wasn't as excited as I thought I'd be.

609
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:03,840
Instead, I felt a kind of

610
00:27:05,520 --> 00:27:07,320
emptiness from losing my goal.

611
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:09,680
Why do you say that?

612
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:13,040
I feel that

613
00:27:13,280 --> 00:27:14,320
the help I can provide for Yufeng Battalion

614
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,120
and for Guo Zijian and the others

615
00:27:19,320 --> 00:27:20,920
is becoming less and less.

616
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:22,120
You're wrong.

617
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:23,480
Without you,

618
00:27:24,520 --> 00:27:26,480
Yufeng Battalion and Guo Zijian wouldn't be where they are today.

619
00:27:28,040 --> 00:27:28,560
True.

620
00:27:31,640 --> 00:27:32,920
But what about their tomorrow?

621
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:36,720
Lao Suo.

622
00:27:38,200 --> 00:27:40,080
In the tide of this military reform, we are all just

623
00:27:40,080 --> 00:27:41,200
a single drop of water.

624
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:44,080
I understand how you feel.

625
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:46,920
And I know what you're trying to express.

626
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:48,520
But,

627
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:51,800
I don't know how to answer you.

628
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:56,000
Let me offer a phrase for us both to remember.

629
00:27:57,800 --> 00:27:58,480
Look ahead.

630
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:03,360
Yes, Chief.

631
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:13,400
If we do the review based on your plan,

632
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:15,480
I think it's too complicated and unnecessary.

633
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:17,320
How is it complicated?

634
00:28:17,880 --> 00:28:19,040
A review plan should be

635
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,040
a bit more detailed.

636
00:28:21,920 --> 00:28:22,400
Look here.

637
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,080
Staff Officer Liang is here too.

638
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,120
Battalion Commander Jiang.

639
00:28:26,080 --> 00:28:26,640
What are you here for?

640
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:27,880
Business.

641
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:30,560
Battalion Commander, I'll be going then.

642
00:28:30,560 --> 00:28:31,800
No, no, no, Staff Officer Liang.

643
00:28:32,280 --> 00:28:32,880
Hold on.

644
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:33,920
Come with me.

645
00:28:34,040 --> 00:28:34,840
I've already found a place.

646
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:36,480
But I still have to be on duty.

647
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:38,320
Isn't Lao Sang around?

648
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:38,760
Let's go, let's go.

649
00:28:38,760 --> 00:28:40,200
I'll take you to Deputy Brigade Commander Suo to ask for leave.

650
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:40,680
Let's go.

651
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,320
You treating me to a meal out of nowhere...

652
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:51,760
this isn't a setup, is it?

653
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:53,920
Guo Zijian,

654
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:56,880
nothing happens for no reason.

655
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:01,880
Ever since you joined the 396th Brigade,

656
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,080
we haven't seen eye to eye.

657
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:04,960
Right?

658
00:29:07,160 --> 00:29:08,200
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo suggested

659
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,200
that I have a chat with you.

660
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,680
To clear the air,

661
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:13,520
so we can work better together moving forward.

662
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,040
This meal was his idea, too.

663
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:19,600
So, are we talking?

664
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,840
Talk about what? Let's eat first.

665
00:29:22,840 --> 00:29:23,520
Come on, dig in.

666
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:25,520
Hold on.

667
00:30:01,960 --> 00:30:02,640
Reporting.

668
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:04,800
Come in.

669
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,040
Guo Zijian,

670
00:30:15,360 --> 00:30:16,280
to tell you the truth,

671
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:18,080
ever since I met you,

672
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:20,680
I've never respected you.

673
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:23,760
It's written all over your face.

674
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:24,600
I could tell.

675
00:30:25,320 --> 00:30:26,160
Can I continue?

676
00:30:29,360 --> 00:30:30,560
Back then, because of you,

677
00:30:31,080 --> 00:30:33,040
I lost the chance to be a top cadet.

678
00:30:34,320 --> 00:30:35,520
I still don't understand.

679
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:36,920
I really don't.

680
00:30:37,040 --> 00:30:37,800
Why you would do something

681
00:30:37,800 --> 00:30:39,080
that hurts others without benefiting yourself.

682
00:30:40,880 --> 00:30:42,240
If I didn't fight seriously,

683
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:44,440
and handed this

684
00:30:44,840 --> 00:30:47,000
promotion spot to you on a silver platter,

685
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,960
would you be proud to be the top cadet?

686
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,160
Your 'fighting seriously'

687
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,520
was turning my staff officer against me,

688
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:57,080
and having him

689
00:30:57,080 --> 00:30:58,560
respectfully lead you

690
00:30:58,560 --> 00:31:00,000
into my command post

691
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,160
to take me out.

692
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:02,000
Right?

693
00:31:02,760 --> 00:31:03,560
Thanks a lot.

694
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:06,960
Speaking of which,

695
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:08,480
how did you turn him?

696
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,720
Now you're asking me?

697
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:13,400
That staff officer of yours,

698
00:31:13,560 --> 00:31:14,360
that kid

699
00:31:14,600 --> 00:31:16,160
had his eye on your spot for a while.

700
00:31:17,360 --> 00:31:19,040
You were sold out like a fool,

701
00:31:19,040 --> 00:31:20,000
and you didn't even know it.

702
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:21,800
You even treated him as a confidant.

703
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,360
A commander like you

704
00:31:24,360 --> 00:31:25,240
in a TV show

705
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,640
would survive one episode at most.

706
00:31:28,040 --> 00:31:29,520
I made you see clearly

707
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:30,920
this person's true colors.

708
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,200
Don't be ungrateful when you benefited.

709
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:32,520
What?

710
00:31:32,520 --> 00:31:33,360
I'm supposed to thank you?

711
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:34,880
No need to be so polite.

712
00:31:36,520 --> 00:31:37,320
Can I continue?

713
00:31:37,320 --> 00:31:38,600
Sure.

714
00:31:38,600 --> 00:31:39,280
Go on.

715
00:31:39,280 --> 00:31:40,680
Air all your grievances.

716
00:31:45,240 --> 00:31:46,040
Then later,

717
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:48,720
because you forged military orders,

718
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:50,640
you had me, the 1st Battalion,

719
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:52,920
and the whole 396th Brigade running in circles.

720
00:31:53,840 --> 00:31:54,840
Tell me yourself,

721
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:56,920
wasn't that shameless?

722
00:31:59,120 --> 00:32:00,240
It was quite shameless.

723
00:32:05,280 --> 00:32:06,520
The rest of the charges,

724
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:07,960
I'll list for you.

725
00:32:09,200 --> 00:32:10,040
Being greedy for credit and reckless,

726
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:11,960
disobeying orders,

727
00:32:12,440 --> 00:32:13,080
and acting willfully,

728
00:32:13,560 --> 00:32:16,240
leading to a crushing defeat against the 404th Brigade.

729
00:32:17,280 --> 00:32:18,520
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo was captured,

730
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:21,320
and Wu Dongsheng lost his leg.

731
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:24,080
Still unrepentant,

732
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:25,400
causing a scene at the Party Committee.

733
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,160
And also,

734
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:30,280
towards you, my old rival,

735
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:32,520
I never showed any mercy.

736
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:37,040
What do you mean, no mercy?

737
00:32:37,360 --> 00:32:39,040
Do I need your mercy?

738
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:40,800
Spicy chicken,

739
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:42,840
sliced beef in chili sauce,

740
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:44,720
twice-cooked pork,

741
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:47,000
and Mapo tofu.

742
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:48,280
All extra numbing and spicy,

743
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:49,000
just your favorites.

744
00:32:49,080 --> 00:32:50,520
I made them all myself.

745
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:52,080
Great.

746
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,440
Time for a feast.

747
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,840
Too bad we can't drink.

748
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:57,040
The usual,

749
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:58,000
tea instead of liquor.

750
00:32:58,640 --> 00:32:59,080
You got it.

751
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:11,640
What do you mean?

752
00:33:15,360 --> 00:33:16,400
A taste of home.

753
00:33:17,280 --> 00:33:18,360
What do you mean?

754
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:23,880
Stop making a fuss.

755
00:33:25,680 --> 00:33:26,320
Have a seat.

756
00:33:33,360 --> 00:33:35,640
Actually, I've had this thought for a while.

757
00:33:38,360 --> 00:33:39,400
It's just that I've never...

758
00:33:40,040 --> 00:33:41,520
...been able to make up my mind.

759
00:33:48,840 --> 00:33:49,560
Why?

760
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:55,120
Yufeng Battalion is on the rise right now.

761
00:33:56,360 --> 00:33:57,240
In this recent drill,

762
00:33:57,400 --> 00:34:00,040
we received unanimous praise from our superiors again.

763
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:01,480
You played a huge part in it.

764
00:34:01,800 --> 00:34:03,880
You have such a bright future ahead of you.

765
00:34:04,040 --> 00:34:05,080
Why leave the army now?

766
00:34:05,080 --> 00:34:06,000
What are you thinking?

767
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:09,800
What is a soldier's future?

768
00:34:13,160 --> 00:34:14,440
It's dedication.

769
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:17,120
It's sacrifice.

770
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,680
I told you that when you were a recruit.

771
00:34:22,640 --> 00:34:23,400
Don't you remember?

772
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:25,680
I remember.

773
00:34:26,200 --> 00:34:26,760
But...

774
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:28,160
But after all these years,

775
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:32,320
how much of that have we actually achieved?

776
00:34:39,440 --> 00:34:41,280
You have a deep understanding of everything else.

777
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,600
Except for the very last point.

778
00:34:43,520 --> 00:34:44,360
Guo Zijian, do you know...

779
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:45,680
...what I can't stand the most about you?

780
00:34:46,040 --> 00:34:46,960
That I'm more handsome than you?

781
00:34:47,200 --> 00:34:48,480
That's not the point.

782
00:34:53,640 --> 00:34:54,600
You have a higher degree than me.

783
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:56,400
You have more tricks up your sleeve.

784
00:34:57,240 --> 00:34:57,960
You're smarter than me,

785
00:34:58,240 --> 00:34:59,240
and you're more shameless.

786
00:35:01,440 --> 00:35:02,680
You always have the upper hand.

787
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:06,600
I refused to accept it.

788
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:11,480
But I couldn't admit defeat.

789
00:35:12,760 --> 00:35:14,440
The entire 2nd Battalion is watching me.

790
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,480
I'm the commander of the 2nd Battalion.

791
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:20,720
I have to lead the entire 2nd Battalion...

792
00:35:21,800 --> 00:35:22,880
...to keep charging forward.

793
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:26,560
But I could never catch up to you.

794
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,600
I tried everything, but I just couldn't.

795
00:35:32,040 --> 00:35:33,000
Every time I felt that...

796
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:34,720
...your little schemes...

797
00:35:34,720 --> 00:35:35,640
...wouldn't be a problem this time...

798
00:35:35,640 --> 00:35:36,520
...and that I could handle them,

799
00:35:37,360 --> 00:35:39,080
you'd always come up with something new.

800
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:42,480
I was so frustrated.

801
00:35:42,480 --> 00:35:44,040
Why couldn't I catch up?

802
00:35:44,520 --> 00:35:46,640
Why couldn't I catch up to you, Guo Zijian?

803
00:35:50,200 --> 00:35:51,040
Until...

804
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:54,320
...you dragged me along to see Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

805
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:56,280
I finally found the reason.

806
00:35:58,600 --> 00:35:59,280
To be honest,

807
00:36:00,080 --> 00:36:00,880
field training...

808
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:02,920
...and the application of new equipment...

809
00:36:04,160 --> 00:36:04,800
...do you think I didn't want that?

810
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:05,600
I did.

811
00:36:08,440 --> 00:36:09,080
But I didn't dare.

812
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:12,080
I didn't dare to propose it.

813
00:36:14,040 --> 00:36:14,840
But you're different.

814
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:19,160
You dare to take big strides forward.

815
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:22,000
You dared to boldly approach Deputy Brigade Commander Suo...

816
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:23,200
...to state your requests...

817
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,600
...and present your suggestions.

818
00:36:28,880 --> 00:36:29,400
I concede.

819
00:36:31,720 --> 00:36:32,360
I concede.

820
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:38,200
As the saying goes,

821
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:42,480
"A weak soldier fails alone; a weak commander ruins the unit."

822
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:45,960
As the commander of the 2nd Battalion,

823
00:36:48,280 --> 00:36:49,600
I lack that kind of backbone,

824
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:53,640
causing all the officers and men of the 2nd Battalion

825
00:36:54,120 --> 00:36:56,000
to stagnate right alongside me.

826
00:36:56,680 --> 00:36:58,360
Even the new sights issued from above,

827
00:36:58,360 --> 00:36:59,080
we didn't dare to use them.

828
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,360
We're not like your 1st Battalion.

829
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:05,600
Last time,

830
00:37:06,680 --> 00:37:07,560
watching Tan Ke

831
00:37:07,720 --> 00:37:09,040
and Yang Maolin spar,

832
00:37:10,040 --> 00:37:10,680
we lost.

833
00:37:13,680 --> 00:37:15,080
But I wasn't focused on winning or losing.

834
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:17,400
What I saw was the cohesion of the 1st Battalion.

835
00:37:19,160 --> 00:37:20,920
I saw the soul of the 1st Battalion.

836
00:37:24,640 --> 00:37:25,840
You brought all of that.

837
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,320
That's what our 2nd Battalion lacks.

838
00:37:31,240 --> 00:37:32,120
Thinking back to the past,

839
00:37:33,240 --> 00:37:34,200
in every exercise,

840
00:37:35,560 --> 00:37:37,240
the 1st Battalion was crushed under my feet.

841
00:37:38,520 --> 00:37:39,520
But after you arrived,

842
00:37:41,520 --> 00:37:42,200
going from catching up,

843
00:37:43,080 --> 00:37:43,760
to tying with us,

844
00:37:45,160 --> 00:37:46,400
and then surpassing our 2nd Battalion,

845
00:37:47,560 --> 00:37:48,720
it's all because of you.

846
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:51,920
Because of a commander like you.

847
00:37:53,480 --> 00:37:54,440
For the sake of combat capability,

848
00:37:57,440 --> 00:37:58,600
you'll do whatever it takes.

849
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:04,240
No matter how capable I seem,

850
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:07,600
I still went to

851
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,520
the training unit as an instructor,

852
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:12,960
served as the support team captain,

853
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:16,640
and even delivered boxed lunches to you.

854
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:20,160
Jiang Shengqiang,

855
00:38:20,160 --> 00:38:21,880
I'm not as unfazed as you say.

856
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:24,880
Ever since

857
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,720
I came to the 396th Brigade,

858
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,480
and went through so much,

859
00:38:31,160 --> 00:38:32,000
deep down,

860
00:38:33,040 --> 00:38:33,840
I've felt bad,

861
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:35,640
suffered,

862
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:37,000
and struggled too.

863
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:40,440
I've even had thoughts of giving up.

864
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,760
But we are soldiers.

865
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,200
We can endure anything,

866
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:49,680
but we just can't admit defeat.

867
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,480
We can't admit defeat to our opponents,

868
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:55,920
and we can't admit defeat to ourselves.

869
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:03,120
That's right.

870
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:05,640
Can't admit defeat.

871
00:39:08,040 --> 00:39:09,440
The entire process of this exercise,

872
00:39:09,560 --> 00:39:10,520
I observed it all.

873
00:39:11,240 --> 00:39:11,960
To be honest,

874
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,720
if it were our Jufeng Battalion,

875
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:15,600
wanting to win

876
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:16,920
would be very difficult.

877
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:20,360
I admit,

878
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:23,120
Jufeng Battalion currently falls behind Yufeng Battalion.

879
00:39:24,080 --> 00:39:24,760
But Guo Zijian,

880
00:39:25,160 --> 00:39:26,240
just like you said,

881
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:28,120
"never admit defeat."

882
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:30,760
I will never admit defeat.

883
00:39:30,920 --> 00:39:32,920
Our 2nd Battalion won't admit defeat either.

884
00:39:34,720 --> 00:39:36,080
I will keep chasing you,

885
00:39:37,360 --> 00:39:39,080
and always be your rival.

886
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:41,200
Be careful.

887
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:42,960
Don't let me surpass you.

888
00:39:44,520 --> 00:39:46,360
I will keep challenging you.

889
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,800
We have a long road ahead.

890
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:52,680
I'll be waiting.

891
00:39:53,600 --> 00:39:55,520
I look forward to the day you can defeat me.

892
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:56,520
We'll

893
00:39:57,280 --> 00:39:58,440
let the battlefield decide the hero.

894
00:39:59,760 --> 00:40:00,320
The battlefield

895
00:40:01,680 --> 00:40:02,320
will decide the hero.

896
00:40:04,040 --> 00:40:04,880
Let me ask you something.

897
00:40:06,640 --> 00:40:08,640
You wrote the report letter against Guo Zijian, right?

898
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,440
No need to deny it.

899
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:13,800
I've read the letter.

900
00:40:15,920 --> 00:40:17,600
From beginning to end,

901
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:22,360
it was full of your strong personal bias.

902
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:24,480
Every single thing

903
00:40:25,160 --> 00:40:26,760
was an exaggeration,

904
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:28,720
blowing things out of proportion.

905
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:30,840
Right?

906
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:34,440
I know that

907
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:36,680
ever since Guo Zijian

908
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:39,040
messed up our exercise with the Infantry Academy,

909
00:40:39,600 --> 00:40:40,920
you've been holding a grudge

910
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:42,680
and opposing him at every turn.

911
00:40:44,600 --> 00:40:45,640
Am I right?

912
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:47,440
I exaggerated?

913
00:40:48,600 --> 00:40:50,440
Isn't he just putting on an act?

914
00:40:52,280 --> 00:40:52,840
As soon as he arrives,

915
00:40:54,120 --> 00:40:55,040
he's right about everything,

916
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:55,880
and he knows everything.

917
00:40:56,320 --> 00:40:57,560
He always has to show off

918
00:40:57,560 --> 00:40:58,880
his personal brilliance.

919
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:02,280
He's just an instructor from a military academy.

920
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:04,640
Could he possibly know better

921
00:41:05,160 --> 00:41:06,480
than those of us on the frontline

922
00:41:06,480 --> 00:41:08,040
who have worked at the grassroots for years?

923
00:41:08,040 --> 00:41:08,840
Does he really understand more?

924
00:41:10,240 --> 00:41:12,200
He says I'm not fit to be the Chief of Training.

925
00:41:12,640 --> 00:41:14,040
Is his way the only right way?

926
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:15,880
Such expensive equipment,

927
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:17,440
before a battle is even fought,

928
00:41:18,120 --> 00:41:19,120
just during an exercise,

929
00:41:19,120 --> 00:41:20,240
he practically tried to ruin it.

930
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:21,360
And

931
00:41:23,040 --> 00:41:23,960
Wu Dongsheng,

932
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:25,720
such a good soldier,

933
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:28,360
if it weren't for Guo Zijian's reckless mindset,

934
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:29,840
would he have lost that leg?

935
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,280
No matter how talented he is,

936
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:35,680
if everyone in our unit were like him,

937
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:36,960
it wouldn't take long

938
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,240
before not just his Yufeng Battalion,

939
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:40,240
but our entire brigade,

940
00:41:40,240 --> 00:41:42,840
would be completely ruined by him, men and gear alike.

941
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:44,120
He has his problems,

942
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:46,120
and you have yours.

943
00:41:46,120 --> 00:41:46,520
Me?

944
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:51,600
Speaking of problems,

945
00:41:53,360 --> 00:41:54,080
Chief,

946
00:41:55,760 --> 00:41:56,920
my big brother,

947
00:41:57,680 --> 00:41:59,280
I have a bellyful of grievances myself.

948
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:00,600
Fine then,

949
00:42:02,400 --> 00:42:04,320
let's get it all out in the open today.

950
00:42:05,040 --> 00:42:07,240
Pour out all the grievances you have inside.

951
00:42:09,360 --> 00:42:10,160
My grievances

952
00:42:10,600 --> 00:42:12,000
aren't just for myself,

953
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:12,880
but also for you,

954
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:13,640
and Lao Jiang.

955
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:14,400
Go ahead.

956
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:15,960
I'm listening.

957
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:23,280
Before Guo Zijian came along,

958
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:25,320
what was our brigade like?

959
00:42:26,200 --> 00:42:27,960
Weren't we doing just fine?

960
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:30,680
So why is it that the moment he arrives,

961
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:32,200
suddenly everything is wrong?

962
00:42:32,800 --> 00:42:35,560
My position as Chief of Operations and Training is gone.

963
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,600
Is Old Jiang really that inferior to him?

964
00:42:38,760 --> 00:42:40,720
His main attack battalion spot is gone too.

965
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:42,760
And then there's you.

966
00:42:43,480 --> 00:42:46,280
Just how much longer do you plan on sitting

967
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,920
in the Deputy Brigade Commander's seat?

968
00:42:49,080 --> 00:42:51,000
So you wrote the report letter.

969
00:42:51,080 --> 00:42:51,680
Right?
